          "message": {
            "text": "Even with both native companions available, dotted-circle insertion must remain explicit before font-run splitting. Chromium inserts U+25CC while the source script and broken-syllable state are still intact; Domotion’s fallback splitter can terminate on a first-candidate or hidden system face before the later HarfBuzz proxy sees equivalent context. The macOS 26 CI images exposed this as Telugu U+0C04/U+0C5D and Kannada U+0C84/U+0CDD painting outside their cells. The capture probe and face-local HarfBuzz query decide the general rule; this is not a codepoint/font exception.",
            "markdown": "Even with both native companions available, dotted-circle insertion must remain explicit before font-run splitting. Chromium inserts U+25CC while the source script and broken-syllable state are still intact; Domotion’s fallback splitter can terminate on a first-candidate or hidden system face before the later HarfBuzz proxy sees equivalent context. The macOS 26 CI images exposed this as Telugu U+0C04/U+0C5D and Kannada U+0C84/U+0CDD painting outside their cells. The capture probe and face-local HarfBuzz query decide the general rule; this is not a codepoint/font exception."
