          "message": {
            "text": "Helper-backed dotted-circle classification now crosses the same boundary as Chromium: pinned ICU supplies General Category, Script, and Indic Syllabic Category; fallback selects a concrete face; vendored HarfBuzz shapes the orphan on that face; and the returned glyph stream proves whether that face emitted its U+25CC glyph. No Unicode block, plane, or font-name sample participates.",
            "markdown": "Helper-backed dotted-circle classification now crosses the same boundary as Chromium: pinned ICU supplies General Category, Script, and Indic Syllabic Category; fallback selects a concrete face; vendored HarfBuzz shapes the orphan on that face; and the returned glyph stream proves whether that face emitted its U+25CC glyph. No Unicode block, plane, or font-name sample participates."
