          "message": {
            "text": "DM-2444 keeps shaping and spacing ownership separate. Chromium 7d859f27 applies spacing only after HarfBuzz shaping at cluster boundaries (shape_result.cc:992-1045), so path emission now anchors each cluster to the captured post-spacing Range origin while retaining HarfBuzz advances and GPOS offsets inside the cluster. Synthetic controls cover positive, negative, normal and cursive-suppressed spacing, ligatures, multi-glyph clusters, RTL and bidi reversal; the focused text-small visual falls from one 76 px region to zero regions (diffPct=0.0035733).",
            "markdown": "DM-2444 keeps shaping and spacing ownership separate. Chromium 7d859f27 applies spacing only after HarfBuzz shaping at cluster boundaries (`shape_result.cc:992-1045`), so path emission now anchors each cluster to the captured post-spacing Range origin while retaining HarfBuzz advances and GPOS offsets inside the cluster. Synthetic controls cover positive, negative, normal and cursive-suppressed spacing, ligatures, multi-glyph clusters, RTL and bidi reversal; the focused `text-small` visual falls from one 76 px region to zero regions (`diffPct=0.0035733`)."
