          "message": {
            "text": "Paint geometry is resolved per selected run, not on the primary-font outer group. This preserves the correct synthesis decision and units-per-em conversion for mixed fallback runs; when Skia requires opaque stroke-first ordering, both groups repeat the identical use stream and differ only in source-owned paint attributes.",
            "markdown": "Paint geometry is resolved per selected run, not on the primary-font outer group. This preserves the correct synthesis decision and units-per-em conversion for mixed fallback runs; when Skia requires opaque stroke-first ordering, both groups repeat the identical use stream and differ only in source-owned paint attributes."
          },
          "locations": [
