            "text": "Absolute decoration lengths must carry Blink effective zoom exactly once. The used font size already scales em and percentage values, but computed px values remain logical CSSOM lengths; lengthScale closes only that branch. The pinned Linux zoom=1.25 discriminator changed from 108/109 SVG geometry to 109/109 without changing the 0.3px envelope.",
