          "guid": "mti4sxv97vm2nwlh",
          "message": {
            "text": "Promote target-size FreeType geometry only for Linux WenQuanYiZenHeiMono at 17 CSS px, weight 400, upright, normal stretch, authored text-rendering:auto, no author stroke or small-caps scaling. The pinned phase oracle makes this strike exact while the same transformation is mixed/worse at WQY 13/20/32; broad family activation is therefore unsupported. Playback remains an embedded data-font and never resolves a host font.",
            "markdown": "Promote target-size FreeType geometry only for Linux WenQuanYiZenHeiMono at 17 CSS px, weight 400, upright, normal stretch, authored text-rendering:auto, no author stroke or small-caps scaling. The pinned phase oracle makes this strike exact while the same transformation is mixed/worse at WQY 13/20/32; broad family activation is therefore unsupported. Playback remains an embedded data-font and never resolves a host font."
