          "guid": "mti9p9mrb3cksghz",
          "message": {
            "text": "DM-2626's fixture-level oracle proves face/gid/cluster/span parity for all 520 checks; the 21-region residual is therefore terminal strike, not fallback. On pinned amd64 Linux, exact 32px y strikes for the fixture's LiberationSans, FreeSans, and FreeSerif source faces reduce the fixture from 21 regions / 0.0543% coverage / 0.2382% diff to 1 region / 0.00344% coverage / 0.0440% diff. Full hinted x for FreeSans did not improve the remaining U+1EFE region, so production retains design x.",
            "markdown": "DM-2626's fixture-level oracle proves face/gid/cluster/span parity for all 520 checks; the 21-region residual is therefore terminal strike, not fallback. On pinned amd64 Linux, exact 32px y strikes for the fixture's LiberationSans, FreeSans, and FreeSerif source faces reduce the fixture from 21 regions / 0.0543% coverage / 0.2382% diff to 1 region / 0.00344% coverage / 0.0440% diff. Full hinted x for FreeSans did not improve the remaining U+1EFE region, so production retains design x."
